  "title": "Ham Balls",
  "description": "Mix ground smoked ham, sausage and beef together with milk, eggs and graham cracker crumbs for a new spin on meatballs. Form into balls and bake in a tangy sauce of tomato, vinegar, brown sugar and mustard powder.",
  "authors": [
    "Beth"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-01-17T11:28:01-05:00",
